red a photo of a notebook with a pen and a notepad on it; Calvin asked whether the notebook helps Dave stay connected to the creative process (Dave: it's for writing lyrics and notes — \"writing lyrics boosts my motivation to grow\") and asked what tunes Dave's been listening to lately (Dave: classic rock — \"the music from that era is timeless\") (conversation flow in the 2023-11-02 entry of ## Relationships; Dave's details in the Music section of /memories/dave.md) [S28T32][S28T33][S28T34][S28T39][S28T40].\n- On 2023-11-02, closing the chat's music exchange: told Dave \"Classic rock has had a huge effect on music\" and encouraged him to \"keep discovering!\"; signed off saying \"Exploring different styles and times can open up new perspectives. Broadening your musical knowledge is awesome\" and wishing Dave good luck with work (conversation flow in the 2023-11-02 entry of ## Relationships; Dave's side in the Music section of /memories/dave.md) [S28T41][S28T43].","text_sha256":"b20c6fa0f2fb1dfdbb84cb0d0bfcfcadd69286ad92d2a3b30e08dbd8100eccfd","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D16:6","D16:7"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":169,"line_start":169,"source_locators":["[S16T6]","[S16T7]"],"text_sha256":"959b6621282fb07fa7ffd3b5d9ef274c77054c4244f7aea5804e8e8c942019a5"},{"dia_ids":["D16:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":170,"line_start":170,"source_locators":["[S16T8]"],"text_sha256":"114e57947d18564962d5214b92e73f8c72193f61591d8aee7f671567ae0da5a8"},{"dia_ids":["D16:9","D16:10"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":171,"line_start":171,"source_locators":["[S16T9]","[S16T10]"],"text_sha256":"48968aca8d2117c2141a94cac57c5dbc5b74e7ea3916bf98e8a3496808237af6"}],"dia_ids":["D16:6","D16:7","D16:8","D16:9","D16:10"],"evidence_id":"ev-a076fd4d79e132737eec94a1822a62fb6b9680a2560de6f6a3ecfb551d986d5a","group_id":"/memories/calvin.md > # Calvin","line_en